     * local date `YYYY-MM-DD`, `offsetSeconds` its UTC offset, `nowIso` the
     * UTC RFC3339 stamp for row mutations, `localStamp` the human-readable
     * "Last synced" stamp (desktop uses `yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm`).
